WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
How to book an appointment in four steps.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Choose the service you need.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 2: Fill in the appointment request form.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 3: Wait for our call to confirm your time.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step 4: Bring your CNIC or B-form to the clinic.
